12 colophons by Gong Weiliu’s 宮偉鏐 (1611–1680) contemporaries: 

Fang Gongqian 方拱乾 (1596–1667, jinshi of 1628); 
Jiang Cai 姜埰 (1607–1673); 
Liang Yizhang 梁以樟 (1608–1665); 
Du Shaokai 杜紹凱 (also named Du Jie 杜岕, 1617–after 1689), dated 1648; 
Zhao Kaixin 趙開心 (d. 1663), dated 1647; 
Zhao Erbian 趙而忭 (d. 1658); 
Yu Yaoguang 余耀光, dated 1649; 
Yao Quan 姚佺, dated 1648; 
Chen Taisun 陳台孫 (b. 1611, jinshi of 1640); 
(Monk) Shao 韶; 
Du Zhujin 杜祝進; 
and Tang Shi 唐時.

Collectors' seals including:
Gong Ben'ang 宮本昂 (1821–1874);
Lian Qian 廉泉 (1868–1932);
Wu Zhiying 吳芝瑛 (1868–1933)
